Error: HELMDESK_API_KEY environment variable is required.

Usage:
  HELMDESK_API_KEY=sk_live_xxx npx @helmdesk/mcp
  HELMDESK_API_KEY=sk_live_xxx HELMDESK_PROJECT=my-app npx @helmdesk/mcp

Or in Claude Desktop config (claude_desktop_config.json):
  {
    "mcpServers": {
      "helmdesk": {
        "command": "npx",
        "args": ["@helmdesk/mcp"],
        "env": { "HELMDESK_API_KEY": "sk_live_xxx", "HELMDESK_PROJECT": "my-app" }
      }
    }
  }

HELMDESK_PROJECT is optional: a key that reaches one project needs none, and
every tool accepts a `project` argument for keys that reach several.
HELMDESK_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox makes a live key act on sandbox data by default;
every tool also accepts an `environment` argument per call.
